# Cloudflare Pages response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
# Lines starting with # are comments. Replace https://api.example.org below with the real API origin
# (the value of REACT_APP_API_URL without the /api/v1 path) before deploying.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy is delivered as Report-Only on purpose: the browser reports what it WOULD block in the
# console but blocks nothing. It was derived from the code, not from a real browser session, and an enforced policy
# written blind could silently break Google sign-in or the fonts. Check the console, then flip it (docs/deployment.md).
#
# What the policy has to allow:
#   script-src   'self' (CRA bundle, the runtime chunk is not inlined) and Google Identity Services,
#                https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client, injected by GoogleSignInButton.js.
#   style-src    'unsafe-inline' (React style={{}} props and Tailwind/CRA injected styles), Google Fonts CSS,
#                jsdelivr (bootstrap-icons.css) and Google's button stylesheet (accounts.google.com/gsi/style).
#   font-src     fonts.gstatic.com (Google Fonts files), jsdelivr (bootstrap-icons font).
#   connect-src  the API origin (axios/fetch) and accounts.google.com/gsi/ (Google sign-in requests).
#   frame-src    accounts.google.com/gsi/ (the Google button and One Tap are iframes).
#   img-src      own files and data: URIs, plus googleusercontent.com (Google profile images shown by the button).

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://accounts.google.com/gsi/style; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; img-src 'self' data: https://*.googleusercontent.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.example.org https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; frame-src https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'

# Hashed build assets never change, so they can be cached forever; index.html must always be revalidated.
/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
